      "writtenOn": "2024-01-05T23:06:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s why it should be a part of the finalization script. You can add it before the frozen step, so both can happen at the same time. I don\u0027t think you should have to create a CL like this manually.\n\nBtw, freezing all the interfaces, the build still succeeds without this... maybe it\u0027s because I\u0027m only checking trunk_staging",
      "parentUuid": "7934fe68_7ead1fc4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 109,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 109,
        "endChar": 42
      },
